.* THIS IS THE ROOT MACRO FOR SUPPORT OF SCHEDULER TABLES EDTTAB AND    00200002
.* PREFTAB. OTHER STAGE 1 MACROS INVOLVED ARE SGIEF214,215,216,212 AND  00250002
.* 211.  THE SGIEF211 MACRO ALSO SUPPORTS OS DEVICE MASK AND NAME       00300002
.* TABLES, TO BE PHASED OUT IN AN EARLY RELEASE OF MVM. HOWEVER,        00350002
.* CODE MUST BE RETAINED IN 211 TO SUPPORT ALTERNATE PATH AND UCB       00400002
.* LOOKUP COMPUTATION.                                                  00450002
.*                                                                      00500002
.* STAGE 2 MACROS SUPPORTING THIS FUNCTION ARE SGIEF010,014,016,        00550002
.* 017,018,019 AND STAGE 2 GLOBAL DECLARE PACK SGIEF020.                00600002
.*                                                                      00650002
.* FOR AN OVERALL VIEW OF THE LOGIC OF THESE MACROS, THE READER IS      00700002
.* REFERRED TO  CHART 9.1 AND SUBORDINATE CHARTS IN THE MVM DEVICE      00750002
.* ALLOCATION  LOGIC CHARTS.                                            00800002
.*                                                                      00850002
.* BRIEFLY, THIS FUNCTION TRANSFORMS INPUT FROM THE INSTALLATION IN     00900002
.* THE FORM OF UNITNAME AND IODEVICE MACROS AND THE DEVPREF PARAMETER   00950002
.* OF THE SCHEDULR MACRO INTO OUTPUTS IN THE FORM OF EDTTAB,PREFTAB,    01000002
.* AND THE NUCLEUS RESIDENT MODULE IEFAQTOP.                            01050002
.* (THE LATTER IS IN SUPPORT OF THE ALLOCATION QUEUE MANAGER            01100002
.* FUNCTION.)                                                           01150002
.*                                                                      01200002
.* THE KEY PROCESS IN BUILDING THE TABLES IS IN MACRO SGIEF214.         01250002
.* THAT MACRO SORTS ALL DEVICES IN THE INSTALLATION INTO GROUPS         01300002
.* ACCORDING TO THEIR ASSOCIATION WITH UNITNAMES. EACH 'GROUP' AS       01350002
.* DEFINED BY SGIEF214 IS A COLLECTION OF DEVICES, ALL OF WHICH ARE     01400002
.* EQUALLY ELIGIBLE TO THE IDENTICAL SET OF NAMES.  INFORMATION         01450002
.* DESCRIBING THE GROUPS IS TRANSMITTED TO STAGE 2 AS PARAMETERS        01500002
.* OF MACRO CALLS AND THE STAGE 2 MACROS UTILIZE THE INFORMATION TO     01550002
.* BUILD THE EDTTAB.                                                    01600002
.*                                                                      01650002
.* IN ADDITION TO THIS PROCESSING,THE DEVICE PRECEDENCE DERIVED FROM    01700002
.* USER SPECIFICATION ON DEVPREF, COMBINED WITH IBM DEFAULTS SUPPLIED   01750002
.* BY SGIEF216 IS ALSO PASSED TO STAGE 2 AND USED THERE FOR GENERATION  01800002
.* OF THE PREFTAB AND ALSO USED IN ORDERING INFORMATION IN EDTTAB.      01850002
.*                                                                      01900002
.* FINALLY, SEVERAL MISCELLANEOUS PROCESSES IN SUPPORT OF THESE         01950002
.* TABLES IS PERFORMED BY MACRO SGIEF215.  THESE INCLUDE GENERATION     02000002
.* OF MULTIPLE GENERIC NAMES FOR SOME TAPE DEVICES, GENERATION FOR      02050002
.* SOME TAPE NAMES OF ELIGIBILITIES TO OTHER TYPES, GENERATION OF THE   02100002
.* SYSALLDA NAME AND ITS ELIGIBILITIES, AND PROCESSING OF VAM           02150002
.* ELIGIBILITIES.                                                       02200002
.*                                                                      02250002
.* SGIEF212 IS USED AS IN MVT, TO IDENTIFY WHICH GENERIC NAMED TYPES    02300002
.* OF DEVICES ARE PRESENT IN THE SYSTEM, ASSIGN TYPE CODES, AND         02350002
.* TRANSMIT THE INFORMATION TO STAGE 2 VIA MACRO SGIEF010.              02370064
.*                                                                      02450002
.********************************************************************   02500002
